    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Le r\u00e9alisateur Steve Faigenbaum revient \u00e0 D\u00e9troit apr\u00e8s 25 ans d\u2019absence. A travers une enqu\u00eate personnelle, il nous d\u00e9voile les racines de la plus grosse faillite d\u2019une cit\u00e9 am\u00e9ricaine. Une histoire qui nous rappelle que nos villes ne sont pas immortelles\u2026",
        "english": "Director Steve Faigenbaum returned to Detroit after a 25\u2010year absence. Realizing he had witnessed a slow motion catastrophe, he searched for the roots of the collapse of America\u2019s once mighty industrial capital. The film is a stark reminder that our cities, and, our way of life, are not immortal."
